===Verb===
{{head|en|verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To have a more [[interesting]], [[eventful]], or [[worthwhile]] [[existence]].

====Usage notes====
* Most often used in the [[imperative]], as a derogatory dismissal addressed to someone considered [[stuffy]], [[tedious]], or excessively [[nosy]].

